---
component: witness
# A beat template (dsl 0.27.0 §6): every islander's interview answers
# `interview`, and only while the engine has them somewhere today.
params:
  who: speaker
  only: { type: string, default: "" }
beat:
  on: interview
  when: "holds('present', [@who, '_']) && (@only)"
---

## Interview

::auto{character=@who anchor="right" action="fadeInUp"}
::body
::auto{character=@who action="fadeOut"}
